{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "9a17237bb2e164b45178407fa7ebe9e964f3e7ec6843dca7a565c06a2db02591", "ja": "Film 03　足りないもの", "zh": "Film 03　所欠缺之物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1240112a76b3c09265542a090281b21fbe2823fab99371afa4366e9c7e5e3980", "ja": "自分達の最初のライブ映像を見ながら、思い\n出を話すメンバー。練習自体は上手くいって\nいるものの、完全に初心者だった最初の活動\nに比べて、がむしゃらさが足りないと感じて\nいた3人は、プロデューサーに相談する。", "zh": "成员们一边观看自己第一次演出的影像，一边谈论着那段回忆。虽然练习本身进展顺利，但3人觉得，与完全还是新手时最初的活动相比，如今少了那股不顾一切的劲头，于是向制作人寻求建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "9b4f366258aba56054a4f46ceb24ed1d1697863fa7ca71e9d6d26a9f762ed957", "ja": "ふんふんふ～ん♪　はぁ～……この時の恵美ちゃんと\n可奈ちゃん、初々しくていいですね～……ムフフ♪", "zh": "嗯嗯嗯～♪　哈啊～……这个时候的惠美和可奈，青涩稚嫩的样子真不错呢～……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "e87ba9e2a3a858d3a1417e532292410c94553aa5411d829427392aa1c85df3c5", "ja": "あれ？　亜利沙、もう来てたんだ。\nお疲れ！", "zh": "咦？亚利沙，你已经来啦。\n辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "d9c2d5d2ad34cc3c9aa2a7cdcface70ea6c6f912c35b34f355588f62d03ebcb1", "ja": "お疲れさまでーす♪\n？　亜利沙さん、何見てるんですか？", "zh": "辛苦啦♪\n？亚利沙，你在看什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "914d3ca7703ee48dac56a6ca32fcc82552f127bf88f2db0942d7df3360d316e0", "ja": "お疲れさまです！　ちょっと早く着いちゃったので、\n『≡君彩≡』のライブ映像をチェックしてました♪", "zh": "辛苦了！因为来得稍微早了一点，所以刚才在看《≡君彩≡》的演唱会影像♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "46c5cd88bed29f0b8a9769bf95667f20296114e6cea6fa2102d3edc820faf0a9", "ja": "わぁ、本当だ！　『庭園』のステージ、懐かしいな～。\nこれが、私たちの初ライブですよね！", "zh": "哇，真的耶！“庭园”的舞台，好让人怀念啊～。\n这就是我们的首场演出呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "41659aef9b33655abb9c3a31488078959df52a195f0312fabef3d2382472fd7f", "ja": "初ライブだけあって、\n今見るとみんな顔が必死だね～。にゃはは。", "zh": "不愧是初次演出，\n现在回头看，大家的表情都好拼命啊～。呀哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "6705d5a8ba5b1287a2ddb5ba672c689e9ebeb2131ff69713754702f4b35a2401", "ja": "そうですね～。「絶対間違えないようにしなくちゃ！」\nって、いっぱいいっぱいでした。", "zh": "是啊～。当时满脑子都是“绝对不能出错！”所以真是忙得不可开交。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "e357481b96ace27ccb4784638a11821036a93d34ae505f26c6502350ef4222c7", "ja": "その表情が、また味わい深く……。\nはぁ、ありさたちの青春の1ページ……♪", "zh": "那个表情也让人回味无穷……  \n唉，有里沙她们青春的第1页……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "a3041ac6db6ed0d04c3640768697a71de7b6428ba8ff7cd5c196a6a7b70aca3e", "ja": "青春か～。このころは、\nバンドのことばっか考えてたよね。", "zh": "青春啊——。那时候，满脑子想的都是乐队呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "39dd95ef87ebad3e8537418d089ddc415707da187487a402f9456a2167d78749", "ja": "ちょっとでも時間があれば、集まって練習してさ。\n帰りに、ファミレスで作戦会議したり。", "zh": "只要一有点时间，我们就会聚在一起练习。\n回去的时候，还会在家庭餐厅开作战会议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "8beb420f581a98095e42ef54076542425fdcc1a10a181bdc9a66989cfdbdffde", "ja": "近くのファミレス、たくさん通いましたよね！\nポテトとパンケーキ、美味しかったなぁ～♪", "zh": "我们经常去附近的家庭餐厅呢！\n薯条和松饼，真好吃啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "713f595ecd78b777f7ba78fad4cb7018faba38012803e4aa8db40137241e5144", "ja": "季節限定モノが出ると、みんなで試したよね！\nあ、あとカラオケにもよく行ったかも！", "zh": "一出季节限定新品，大家就会一起尝尝呢！\n啊，之后可能也经常去唱K吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "fab4d41c30facbfec2cee02f98f899da5fb01ff78413c58a22c42ac1dfd6200c", "ja": "楽器の練習するつもりが、いつの間にか好きな歌の\n布教大会になってたりもしましたね……。", "zh": "本来打算练习乐器，结果不知不觉变成了喜欢歌曲的安利大会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "7b36693a974709aa91c64483005b0ce7cde5c5d8dc4512db42ac34f76cd7d5df", "ja": "途中で気づいて、慌てて練習に戻ったりして。\nちょっと懐かしいな～。", "zh": "中途发现后，又慌慌张张地回去练习了。真让人有点怀念啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "cfbffb59c30be6833374337651ddcd1f34b8e835e610cc18a5e7e8b7342b67df", "ja": "なんか……せっかく再集結できたのに、\n今回はそういうの、あんまりしてないよね。", "zh": "总觉得……好不容易重新聚到一起了，\n这次却没怎么做那种事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "6f83330635ac5f9837b8d451ea8e9824903091401a347d493d1b9fd349db5b64", "ja": "うっ……そうですね。バンドといえば、\nがむしゃらな練習！　そして交流……！", "zh": "呜……确实呢。说到乐队，\n就该拼命练习！然后交流感情……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "aaa619650d56f6e584976ea40ee94494d94bbb026acc23eae85b891869f470ba", "ja": "練習は、割と進んでると思いますケド……ありさは、\n恵美ちゃんと可奈ちゃん成分が足りてないです～っ！", "zh": "我觉得练习还挺顺利的，不过……亚利沙缺少惠美和可奈的成分～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "e13b2e0ff1df92067a755e2d92da9bda701674a658ec0465c224d1735026cac7", "ja": "成分って。ま、でもそれもそっかー。\n結局、今日も2週間ぶりだしね。", "zh": "“成分”啊。不过，想想也是。毕竟今天也是时隔2周才见面嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "4d232d360ec16ed9bb453991a2dbfc8346c186fcc071fc252a9fb0d620bfbee5", "ja": "はい。それに私たち、初ライブよりも\n演奏は上手くなったと思うんですけど……。", "zh": "是的。而且我觉得，我们的演奏比第一次演出时进步了不少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "eab5ff69f87b14d3c25c5395541da612f41033af01cc2c78d7a852be68765594", "ja": "なんだか初ライブの時のほうが、いい音出してたかも？\nって、さっき思っちゃって。", "zh": "不知怎么的，我刚才突然觉得，说不定第一次演出时演奏出的声音还更好听？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "05febe1ab65c329be18b5f16b9b80130f37fd5e5eb7a95b4a9bdc534ffc1e2c4", "ja": "うん……それもわかる。このまま無難に\n演奏を合わせてるだけじゃ、絶対ダメだよね。", "zh": "嗯……我也懂这种感觉。要是继续像这样\n只求稳妥地配合演奏，绝对是不行的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "ae2b14afef58aee3ca128b68364a93574971c7c9bf8d04a9596c20769c5f2eac", "ja": "でも忙しいのはどうしようもないしな～！\nそれでもこなすのが、プロなんだと思うけど！", "zh": "不过忙也是没办法的嘛～！\n即便如此也要完成任务，我觉得这才是专业人士吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "250e8c93fdb145e453fae2c11a642bd2edabc2427b02e501dccac43964cbb26a", "ja": "うう……そうですよね。\nでもでも……やっぱり、ちょっと寂しいな～……♪", "zh": "呜呜……是啊。\n可是可是……果然还是有点寂寞呢～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "77c529646328d459e33086f53375c126c5c794c3ab00a7d3b3cfae1ef3b05e8a", "ja": "仕事が忙しいのも、『庭園』がなくなっちゃったのも。\n仕方ないってわかってるんですけど……。", "zh": "工作变忙也好，『庭园』消失也好，我都知道这是没办法的事……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "9f2f520500743d89bf52099d182fb2313ee6283d03103128a993a46a4ee2e047", "ja": "でもでも！　せっかくまたバンドが組めたんだから、\n恵美さんと亜利沙さんと、前みたいに練習したいです！", "zh": "可是可是！好不容易又组起乐队了，我想和惠美小姐、亚利沙小姐像以前那样一起练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "1b0f056ad4c155ed79715e24803a50cd8cdd5c29d07ec0a96e92de9667de4bed", "ja": "か、可奈ちゃん……！\nそんなの、ありさも、ありさもですよっ！！", "zh": "可、可奈……！  \n那种事，亚利沙也是，亚利沙也想啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "f82ea94705d7bf00cab828301b40d8936be14495e2fb7c9d7449a9c45ccf51ff", "ja": "アタシも。……初ライブの時にさ、\n{$P$}が言ってたじゃん？", "zh": "我也是。……初次演出的时候，\n{$P$}不是说过嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "559bc82a69f53b2b6d6acff860be11f4d96d79b8db7802051237b53a92db704e", "ja": "演奏の上手さとか下手さじゃなくて、お客さんは、\n頑張ってるアタシたちの姿を見に来るんだって。", "zh": "不是来看我们演奏得好不好，而是来看努力着的我们，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "451ac6372ae7bdc4227ab21c6cb1f8397e96dd39cbcf0b42cb1de0a4e5957a45", "ja": "アタシたち、今も頑張ってないわけじゃないけどさ。\n3人でなら、もっと頑張れる気がするんだよね！", "zh": "我们现在也不是没在努力啦。不过，要是有3个人的话，我觉得还能更加努力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_03_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "2c9a97f88325141c3ef0865cac45dfc99180e06e315437c2bf16b1ddc33220a8", "ja": "はいっ！\n私、まだまだがんばれます！", "zh": "好！\n我还可以继续努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
